RESOLUTION - Authorizing the Mayor and City Clerk to execute all documents as
necessary to sell three City-owned properties located at 515 Morrie Avenue, 916 East 5 Street and
th
922 East 5 Street, Cheyenne, Laramie County, Wyoming, together with all improvements thereon --
th
referred to Finance Committee (sponsor - Mr. Brown).  Mr. Brown advised the item was reviewed
under other items for the agenda at Finance Committee, and provisions of Title 2 of City Code have
been met.  Mr. Brown moved to adopt, seconded by Ms. Broyles.  Dan White, City Attorney,
clarified the properties were previously declared surplus and then sold pursuant to Wyo .Stat. § 15-5-
112 (a), which calls for sealed bids or public auction to dispose of the properties.  He advised these
procedures were followed, but the title company involved in the closing (scheduled for 01/15/2013)
had decided at the last minute that they would like a resolution from the City authorizing the Mayor
and City Clerk to execute the documents, which is the purpose of the resolution and the need to act
on it in a timely manner.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body.
